      "date": "2026-10-17 05:26:17.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1: Verified+1\n\nPassed enforced test review-ldiskfs-dne-arm on RHEL 8.10 / x86_64, Rocky 9.8 / aarch64 uploaded by Onyx Autotest from onyx-180vm3: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/04948e33-c263-4d86-bec0-537a214a7930 ran 5 tests.",
